{"5051460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreams Fold", "steam_appid": 5051460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams Fold is a first-person adventure puzzle game.<br>Traverse dreams of various styles to find a bed to sleep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items, solve puzzles, and explore environments.<br>Getting back to bed is the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has five levels, each with three ways to complete.<br>You will also find some familiar elements in each level.<br>Try different paths to find different solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five levels with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has three ways to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find connections between objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find connections between levels</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams Fold is a first-person adventure puzzle game.<br>Traverse dreams of various styles to find a bed to sleep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items, solve puzzles, and explore environments.<br>Getting back to bed is the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has five levels, each with three ways to complete.<br>You will also find some familiar elements in each level.<br>Try different paths to find different solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five levels with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has three ways to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different environments</p